{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12233100","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12233100","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1223310001:0":{"text":"让你见笑了……","source_cn":"让你见笑了……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD33955167163F507","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"让你见笑了……","female":"让你见笑了……","variant_male_record_index":"138531","variant_female_record_index":"138532","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1223310002:1":{"text":"事情发展到这个地步，也没什么好隐瞒的。","source_cn":"事情发展到这个地步，也没什么好隐瞒的。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF63FE5AACC06A364","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"事情发展到这个地步，也没什么好隐瞒的。","female":"事情发展到这个地步，也没什么好隐瞒的。","variant_male_record_index":"138533","variant_female_record_index":"138534","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1223310003:1":{"text":"现在水鬼帮分两拨人，一拨想踏踏实实融入锈锚港工作，另一拨人……<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，你也看到了。","source_cn":"现在水鬼帮分两拨人，一拨想踏踏实实融入锈锚港工作，另一...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7DBE03C07521BAA1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"现在水鬼帮分两拨人，一拨想踏踏实实融入锈锚港工作，另一拨人……<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，你也看到了。","female":"现在水鬼帮分两拨人，一拨想踏踏实实融入锈锚港工作，另一拨人……<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，你也看到了。","variant_male_record_index":"138535","variant_female_record_index":"138536","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1223310004:1":{"text":"哼！搞不过血薇帮，来搞自己人！","source_cn":"哼！搞不过血薇帮，来搞自己人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA92A64A180AD4F62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1223310005:1":{"text":"唉，以雷纳塔为主的其他水鬼帮成员算是一派，就是今天来搞乱的那帮人。","source_cn":"唉，以雷纳塔为主的其他水鬼帮成员算是一派，就是今天来搞...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46C28E459D86C497","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1223310006:1":{"text":"复仇总能让恶棍们更团结，他们还想扳倒血薇帮呢。","source_cn":"复仇总能让恶棍们更团结，他们还想扳倒血薇帮呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF93E0AE67FE43CB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1223310007:1":{"text":"唉，该说他们不识时务呢……还是说他们愚蠢呢？","source_cn":"唉，该说他们不识时务呢……还是说他们愚蠢呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A73D01F02A4B73E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1223310008:1":{"text":"雷纳塔那混蛋！连自己人都搞！我绝对饶不了他们！","source_cn":"雷纳塔那混蛋！连自己人都搞！我绝对饶不了他们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9D2043FC4E44E49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1223310009:1":{"text":"他们早就看我们不顺眼了，这场内斗是难免的。","source_cn":"他们早就看我们不顺眼了，这场内斗是难免的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06A0A1B8B2A71180","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1223310010:1":{"text":"大家都以为水鬼帮沉寂了，如果还有这样的恶党，你们应该报告血薇帮。","source_cn":"大家都以为